                "entry_id": "ada33aab-0577-3fa9-bfbd-0e5c9dd7be76",
                "word": "fascistoïde",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "347ab70b-f144-42de-8112-1bbfae768749",
                        "entry_id": "ada33aab-0577-3fa9-bfbd-0e5c9dd7be76",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "fascistoïdes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6de0d2c2-1dbd-3a56-a136-b14adadbfed2",
                        "entry_id": "ada33aab-0577-3fa9-bfbd-0e5c9dd7be76",
                        "glosses": [
                            "D’une nature, d’une apparence rappelant la pensée fasciste."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "52daa4d8-ab50-4978-bfe4-1d21d1b2ab1d",
                                "sense_id": "6de0d2c2-1dbd-3a56-a136-b14adadbfed2",
                                "text": "Et ceci vaut également — et peut-être surtout — pour les jeunes : étant donné leur situation, l’augmentation de la toxicomanie, de la délinquance, de la violence, et la propagation de modes de pensée fascistoïdes chez les jeunes travailleurs, n’ont rien de surprenant."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7cf6301a-1cf8-49df-bcb0-21b4da408593",
                        "source_entry_id": "ada33aab-0577-3fa9-bfbd-0e5c9dd7be76",
                        "source_sense_id": "6de0d2c2-1dbd-3a56-a136-b14adadbfed2",
                        "target_lang_word": "faschistoid",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "faschistoid",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "48cc528e-0183-3fb8-8a03-c0218b8bcf43",
                                        "entry_id": "f3f65fc7-5ca2-3254-8083-f00e5342a7d0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "dem Faschismus ähnlich, faschistische Eigenschaften aufweisend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f95eaaef-a3d5-44ac-aec9-4bb61ac30527",
                                                "sense_id": "48cc528e-0183-3fb8-8a03-c0218b8bcf43",
                                                "text": "„So groß war der Abscheu vor dem Missbrauch dieser Werte durch den Nazi-Staat, dass in Deutschland, anders als in anderen Pisa-Ländern, die Werte selbst lange Zeit als faschistoid verhasst waren.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53477e70-6a23-4971-b6e3-1c45577266c4",
                                                "sense_id": "48cc528e-0183-3fb8-8a03-c0218b8bcf43",
                                                "text": "„Selbst das beschränkte Maß an Großzügigkeit, das die faschistoiden Regime in Spanien und Portugal an den Tag legten, brachten zwei andere neutrale Länder, die Schweiz und Schweden, bei denen es sich nach allen Maßstäben um Musterdemokratien handelte, nicht auf.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cb1d444d-5441-404c-9130-78ce5e554040",
                        "source_entry_id": "ada33aab-0577-3fa9-bfbd-0e5c9dd7be76",
                        "source_sense_id": "6de0d2c2-1dbd-3a56-a136-b14adadbfed2",
                        "target_lang_word": "fascistic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fascistic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c73b8a3-9dec-3298-9b95-deb0f714814e",
                                        "entry_id": "f51cbf92-2a9c-3252-bd6c-1d9f5961c07b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rare form of fascist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d43d3e8a-05e8-4026-a0d1-4ef6f40db158",
                                                "sense_id": "5c73b8a3-9dec-3298-9b95-deb0f714814e",
                                                "text": "Given the uncanny ability of too many of GCN's readers to perceive mere criticism as a fascistic device, I recognize that by siding with Sporters in the recent hoop-lah when ten or so drag queens invaded the bar last Saturday, I will probably be subjecting myself to unending attack."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfae3665-efda-44cf-8f65-ae52221c2f45",
                                                "sense_id": "5c73b8a3-9dec-3298-9b95-deb0f714814e",
                                                "text": "Much antifa work today involves exposing white supremacists online and taking action to shut down spaces where fascistic desires get fostered, fueled, and legitimized."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
